{
 "description": "Unlimited AI tailoring on every plan: paste the vacancy text, describe how to emphasise matches, translate, or demote noise, and FormaCV returns a tailored CV aligned to that brief while preserving your template system and ATS-safe structure.",
 "inputSchema": {
